# 🌍 Import-Export Trade Analysis Dashboard

This project analyzes international trade data to uncover trends in imports, exports, top trading partners, and product-level insights. Built using **Google Sheets** and **Power BI**, the dashboard helps stakeholders make data-driven decisions around trade strategies.

## 📊 Key Features
- Country-wise import vs export comparison
- Top 10 traded products by volume/value
- Trade surplus/deficit trend line
- Product-wise YoY and MoM growth analysis
- Dynamic filters for year, country, and product category (HS Code)

## 🛠 Tools Used
- Google Sheets (Data cleaning, pre-processing)
- Power BI (Dashboard creation, DAX measures)
- Excel (Data transformation support)

## 📂 Files Included
- `/Data` - Sample anonymized import-export data (CSV/Excel)
- `/PowerBI` - PBIX file of the dashboard
- `/Screenshots` - Dashboard visuals
- `/Scripts` - Any supporting formula logic or calculations used in Google Sheets


